{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">游嘉欣向來以真性情與甜美外貌深受觀眾及網民喜愛，她亦經常在社交平台上與粉絲互動。日前，她上載了一段以「POV：屋企VS出街」為主題的搞笑變身短片，大方展示自己私下在家的真實狀態，以及出街時的精緻造型。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9c086185-ea90-4034-9c00-510215537eb0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026kN8swujIgn1788403957.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9c086185-ea90-4034-9c00-510215537eb0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在短片開首，游嘉欣以素顏的居家造型面對鏡頭，更隨意地做出伸懶腰等動作。她的表現隨性自然，完全放低「女神包袱」，向大眾展現最真實的一面。隨後，她伸出手掌遮擋鏡頭，配合音樂節奏，瞬間完成「一秒變身」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d5df58bf-ba56-4219-b66d-3d2d970a90d9.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20267WoZGKyFR61788403972.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d5df58bf-ba56-4219-b66d-3d2d970a90d9.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鏡頭一轉，游嘉欣即時化身活力十足的「出街 Mode」。變裝後的她換上了一襲深藍色配白邊的運動風無袖背心，並將頭髮精心梳理成半公主頭，配上精緻的妝容。對著鏡頭，她展現出招牌的甜美笑容，散發出滿滿的陽光活力！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5388958d-abfb-42e8-bc7e-e7b539e33c56.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Al2or8Y8du1788403978.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5388958d-abfb-42e8-bc7e-e7b539e33c56.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T14:19:47.759697+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}